  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.47 - AM003 ImmutableArray container support\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM003 now reports ImmutableArray container mismatches in both source and destination directions\n            - Destination ImmutableArray mappings receive a fully qualified ImmutableArray.CreateRange factory fix\n            - Source-side ImmutableArray mappings to known mutable containers keep the safe constructor rewrite path\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (858 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #122 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.46 - AM050 top-level ForPath redundant MapFrom cleanup",
